# 统一换行：文本在仓库内一律 LF，检出时按平台自动转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，避免 diff 和换行转换破坏文件。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 锁文件：不参与语言统计，diff 也不折叠得太狠。
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated=true
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated=true

# Markdown 在 diff 中按行处理，方便评审。
*.md text
